USER - Files: 3
USER - Subsystems: deterministic planner, school-directory preflight handling, input-catalog normalization, pipeline error propagation, unit/integration tests
USER - Rough change: approximately 150–250 implementation lines plus 200–300 lines of focused deterministic tests.
